t watch out for special disguises.<br></li><li>Bull Run - Normal cows, rebel cows, but which is which?<br></li><li>UFO Invaders - Protect your citizens and cattle from being abducted by aliens.<br></li><li>Bodyguard - Identify all hidden spies before they take out your VIPs.<br></li><li>Ape Escape: small-sized gorilla must evade capture from mad scientists with oversized nets.</li></ul><br>====<br><br>Late For Work was in Early Access for 23 months (until June 2019) - for historical reference here is our old roadmap: ",
