                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "There are no reviews so I figure I should get something here to give people an idea.\n\nI tried the game with my wife (who was on a controller) and we had some laughs.  Scrambling around as the gorilla is a bit odd since you need your hands to move (and to hold things) but it \"feels\" right.\n\nI have no regrets over picking it up for 10$, its nice to be able to participate with the person who is in VR and this will be a good laugh with the kids as well.\n\nGrapics are primitive at best, but very colorful and easy to read.",
